  "RejectMovieTicket.1.2": "Thanks for thinking of me, but I've got other plans tonight.$0",
  "RejectMovieTicket.1.3": "Thanks, @, but I'm not feeling up for it today. Maybe another time?$0",

  //DATING, WEDDING, AND ENGAGEMENT LINES//

  "Daulton.Dating.1": "A bouquet? For me? I... yeah, I'd like that. Been hoping you might feel the same way, @.$4",
  "Daulton.Dating.2": "These are beautiful, @. I've been hoping you felt the same way I do. Guess we both took our time figuring it out. I'd love to be with you.$4",
  "Daulton.Engaged.1": "A mermaid pendant... @, you're serious about this? I love you too. More than I thought I could love anyone Yes. Absolutely yes.$1",
  "Daulton.DatingRejection.1": "Hey, these are nice, but... I don't think we're there yet. Maybe we should get to know each other better first.$1",
  "Daulton.DatingRejection.2":"Look, you're great, but I think we work better as friends. Don't want to mess up what we have, you know?$1",
  "Daulton.DatingRejection.3": "Look, you're great, but I think we work better as friends. The kind of friends who don't give each other flowers.$0",
  "Daulton.DatingRejection.4": "Nice flowers. Did you pick them yourself or did Pierre talk you into buying the 'romance package'?$0#$b#Either way, not interested.$0",
  "Daulton.DatingRejection.5": "Bold move. I respect that. But I'm gonna have to pass, @.$0",
  "Daulton.DatingRejection.6": "...No thanks.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.1": "Hey. Been thinking about you... probably more than I should at work.$l",
  "Dating.Flirt.2": "Keep me company later? I promise to make it worth your while.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.3": "Hey you. How's my favorite person doing?$1",
  "Dating.Flirt.4": "You look good today. Well, you always do, but... you know.$l",
  "Dating.Flirt.5": "You free tonight? I've got nowhere to be but with you.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.6": "I was having a rough morning until you showed up.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.7": "There you are. My day just got better.$1",
  "Dating.Flirt.8": "Maple's been spoiled since you came around. We both have.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.9": "Walk with me? I just want to be near you for a bit.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.10": "You look good. Sleep well?$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.11": "Hey. Miss me?$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.12": "You look like you're in a hurry. Slow down, stay a while.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.13": "Careful, I might get used to running into you like this.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.14":  "Hey, don't work too hard. Save some energy for me later.$l",
  "Dating.Flirt.15": "I've got nothing planned tonight. Fix that for me?$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.16": "You look happy today. It's a good look.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.17": "Busy day? Tell me about it. I like hearing you talk.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.18": "You know what I like about you? Everything. That's the problem.$l",
  "Dating.Flirt.19": "Come by tonight. I'll make it worth the trip.$l",
  "Dating.Flirt.20": "You got a minute? Always seem to need more of those with you.$0",
  "Dating.Flirt.21": "Maple's been looking for you. She's not subtle about her favorites.$1",
  "Dating.Flirt.22": "You know, my dad would've liked you. That means something.$0",

  "Dating.Beach.Flirt.1": "Willy's got me running all over today, but... I've got time for you.$0",
  "Dating.Beach.Flirt.2": "Sun's making your hair look... yeah. I'm staring again.$l",
  "Dating.Beach.Flirt.3": "I'm covered in salt and fish scales. Still want to kiss me?$l",

  "Dating.Town.Flirt.1": "You shopping? I'll carry your bags. I'm good at that.$0",
  "Dating.Town.Flirt.2": "I like how everyone knows we're together now. Makes me... I don't know. Proud.$l",
  "Dating.Town.Flirt.3": "Robin asked if we're serious. I said yes before I could think. Hope that's okay.$0",
  "Dating.Town.Flirt.4": "Evelyn just winked at us. I think we're obvious.$1",

  "Dating.Saloon.Flirt.1": "My room's just upstairs, you know. In case you were wondering.$l",
  "Dating.Saloon.Flirt.2": "You should see the view from my window upstairs. Want to?$l",
  "Dating.Saloon.Flirt.3": "The jukebox is playing our song. We don't have one yet, but we could.$l",
  "Dating.Saloon.Flirt.4": "Emily keeps smiling at us. We must look good together.$0",


  "Daulton.engagement0": "I'm a little nervous about this? Aren't you?$4",
  "Daulton.engagement1": "To think I couldn't be anymore happier...$4",
  "Daulton.NotReady.1": "Whoa, a mermaid pendant? That's... that's a big step, @. I care about you, but I think we should take our time with this. Make sure it's right.$1",
  "Daulton.NotReady.2": "A mermaid pendant... that's serious commitment territory. I want to be sure I can be the partner you deserve before we go there.$0",
  "Daulton.NotReady.3": "That's a beautiful pendant, but I'm not ready for that step yet.$0#$b#Doesn't mean I don't care about you. Just means I want to do this right.$1",
  "Daulton.NotReady.4": "Perhaps some day.$1",
  "Daulton.NotReady.5": "Easy there, @. I just got used to having someone steal my hoodies. Marriage is a whole different level of sharing.$1",
  "Daulton.NotReady.6": "A mermaid pendant? Someone's been talking to the old fishermen about traditions. I'm flattered, but let's keep dating for a while longer.$1",
  "Daulton.NotReady.7":  "You know, Maple hasn't even fully accepted you into the family yet. Gotta respect the bunny hierarchy here.$0",
  "RejectBouquet_AlreadyAccepted": "I already said yes once.#$b#No need to double down. We're good, I promise.$1",
  "RejectBouquet_Divorced": "You ended things once. That kind of break doesn’t just... disappear. I’m not ready to go back.$2",
  "RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "...We don’t even really know each other. Maybe start with a conversation first?$0",
  "RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "I like you. I do. But not like that.#$b#Not yet, anyway. Let’s not rush this.",
  "RejectMermaidPendant_AlreadyAccepted": "Didn't we already make that promise? I'm yours. No need to ask again.$1",
  "RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "You're already tied to {0}. That’s not something I want to mess with.$2",
  "RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "You walked away once. I can’t pretend that didn’t leave a mark.$2",
  "RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "I already said no. Please don’t push this.#$b#Things like that should feel right for both of us.",
  "RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "You want me.#$b#And Maple.#$b#To move in? We’d love to, but I’m not cramming that rabbit into a single bed. Gonna need more room first.$1",
  "Daulton_AfterWedding.1.1": "My spouse... I love saying that. Thank you for the most amazing wedding day. I promise I'll do everything I can to make you happy.$4",
  "Daulton_AfterWedding.1.2": "I never thought I'd find someone like you. Today was magical, and now we get to wake up together every morning. I'm so lucky.$4",
  "Daulton_AfterWedding.1.3": "The whole town was there to celebrate with us! But honestly, all I could see was you. You looked absolutely stunning today.$h",
  "Daulton_AfterWedding.1.4": "Today was perfect, but you know what? I'm even more excited about all the ordinary days we'll have together as a married couple.$h",
  "Daulton_AfterWedding.1.5": "The wedding was amazing, but the best part was seeing how happy you looked. That smile of yours could light up the whole valley.$4",
  "Daulton_Engaged.1.1": "I’ve never been someone who planned for forever. But with you, I want to try.$l",
  "Daulton_Engaged.1.2": "I still can't believe we're engaged! Every time I look at this pendant, I get butterflies. I can't wait to marry you, sweetheart.$h",
  "Daulton_Engaged.1.3": "Being engaged to you feels like a dream I don't want to wake up from. Have you thought about what kind of wedding you want?$h",
  "Daulton_Engaged.1.4": "Everyone in town keeps congratulating me on our engagement. I love telling them how lucky I am to marry you.$h",
  "Daulton_Engaged.1.5":"I've been thinking about our wedding nonstop. I want everything to be perfect for you, beautiful.$h",


  //AFFECTION LINES//

  "Daulton.affection.bad.1": "Sometimes I wonder if moving here was the right choice. Things used to be simpler.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.2": "Work's been... fine. Easier than dealing with whatever this is.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.3": "Maybe I'll head to the Saloon later. Could use some space to think.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.4": "Things feel... different around here. Not sure what changed.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.5": "I'll probably be working late again. Don't wait up.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.6": "Maple's been good company lately. At least someone around here still likes me.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.7": "Feels like we're strangers living in the same house these days.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.8": "Been thinking about what Willy said about relationships. Maybe some things just don't work out.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.9": "I'm tired of pretending everything's fine when it's clearly not.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.10": "Feels like I'm walking on eggshells in my own home. That's not right.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.11": "Maple’s been hiding under the table lately. Animals pick up on things.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.12": "I’m tired. Not sure if it’s work, or just... us.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.13": "I know I can be hard to be around sometimes...Doesn’t mean I don’t feel it too.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.14": "Willy asked if everything was alright at home. Didn’t know what to say.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.15": "Look, I’m not mad. Just... I don’t know what we’re doing anymore.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.16": "Yeah, whatever.$2#$b#I've got work to do.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.17": "I'm not really in the mood for conversation right now. Maybe find something else to do.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.18": "You and Elliott seemed pretty deep in conversation earlier.$2#$b#Something I should know?$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.19": "Didn’t realize you and Harvey were grabbing lunch together now.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.bad.20": "Funny how you always seem to run into Alex when I’m not around.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.good.1": "Been thinking about how lucky I am while working at the docks today.$1#$b#Not many people get to come home to someone as amazing as you, babe.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.2": "Love how we've built this life together, @. Everything feels right when you're around. Like all the pieces fit perfectly.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.3": "Been working on a little something for you in my workshop.$1#$b#Can't tell you what it is yet, but I think you're going to love it, babe.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.4": "Sometimes I catch myself smiling for no reason at work.$1#$b#Then I remember I get to come home to you, and it all makes sense.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.5":  "Perfect. I was just thinking about you.$1#$b#Funny how you always show up right when I'm missing you most, love.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.6": "You bring out the best in me, you know that?$1#$b#I'm a better person because of what we have together, love.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.7": "Maple likes you.$0#$b#That’s not nothing. She’s a better judge of character than most people.",
  "Daulton.affection.good.8": "You know, for someone who works sunup to sundown, you still manage to look good covered in hay.$2",
  "Daulton.affection.good.9": "There's that smile I love.$1#$b#You know exactly how to make my whole day better, don't you, @?$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.10": "Marriage to you gets better every day, you know that? I'm one lucky guy, having you in my life, babe.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.11": "You know what I love about being married to you? Everything, @. Absolutely everything about this life we've built.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.12": "There's my favorite person in the entire valley.$1#$b#Marriage to you is the best decision I ever made, @.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.13": "Hey gorgeous. Perfect timing as always. I was just thinking about how lucky I am to have you.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.14": "There's that smile I love.$1#$b#Makes everything better just by being here.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.15": "Hey love. You're looking incredible today. Then again, you always do. I'm a lucky man.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.good.16": "Hey beautiful. Just seeing you makes my whole day better.$1",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.1": "Hey, @. How's your day going?$0#$b#Mine's been pretty decent. Just working on some projects.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.2": "Oh, hey there. Perfect timing. I was just thinking about taking a break anyway.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.3": "Hey, @. Just taking care of some things around here.$0#$b#How are things going on your end?$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.4": "There's my spouse. How's your day treating you?$0#$b#Mine's been pretty standard. Can't complain.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.5": "Maple got herself stuck under the couch again. You’d think she’d learn.$5",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.6": "*yawn* Sorry, didn’t mean to zone out. What were you saying?$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.7": "You ever feel like you blink and it's already next season?$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.8": "I tried cooking again. It was technically edible. Maple judged me the whole time.[241]$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.9": "Fixed the squeaky drawer. Again. Might stay quiet a whole week this time.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.10": "You’re out in the fields a lot lately. Don’t forget to take a break now and then.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.11": "Your goat tried to headbutt me again. We’ve got an understanding now. Sort of.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.12": "Tried your jam this morning. Not bad. A little... experimental. But not bad.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.13": "There you are. I was wondering if I'd see you today.$0#$b#Everything going alright with you?$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.14": "Good to see you. I was just thinking about what to tackle next.$0#$b#Always something that needs attention around here.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.15": "Hey there. Day's been going pretty smoothly.$0#$b#Nothing to complain about, really.$0",
  "Daulton.affection.neutral.16": "You ever wonder what’s actually in Joja Cola? ...Yeah, me neither. Still drinking it.$0",
  
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.0": "Oh, hey. Didn't hear you get up.$0",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.1": "Another day, I guess. Morning, @.$0",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.2": "Hey. You're up early... or maybe I'm up late.$0",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.3": "Daulton stretches and looks tired.",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.4": "Daulton seems lost in thought.",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.5": "Daulton seems a bit withdrawn this morning.",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.6": "Morning. I was just... thinking about stuff.",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.7": "Hey. You look like you slept better than I did.",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.8":  "Oh, morning. I was wondering when you'd get up.",
  "marriage_unhappy.daulton.9": "Daulton yawns and stretches slowly.",

  //INDOOR LINES//

  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.1": "Perfect day to stay inside and work on some projects. Want to keep me company while I tinker?$0",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.2": "Thinking about setting up my drums later. Good day for some music, don't you think, @?$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.3": "Maple’s been doing laps around the living room. I think she’s training for something.$0",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.4": "Caught myself air-drumming with a spatula earlier. Might be time to go outside.$0",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.5": "I tried to cook. It...looked edible. That’s progress, right?$0",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.6": "Maple's been supervising my projects from her corner. Good to have quality control, even if it's just a bunny.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.7": "Hey, I’ve been fine-tuning my drum kit in the corner.#$b#Think I finally nailed that double-kick pattern.#$b#Wanna hear a riff later? Maple’s been keeping me company; she hops around like she’s on a pogo stick whenever I hit the snare.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.8": "I was tinkering with that old fishing rod you gave me.#$b#Added a custom counterweight so I can cast farther.#$b#Tomorrow I’ll try it out by the docks. If Willy sees me, he’ll probably lecture me on ‘proper technique,’ but I’m banking on style over substance.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.9": "Got a new horror game yesterday.#$b#Graphics are so real I nearly spilled my coffee.#$b#Maybe later we can boot it up on the Saloon’s arcade machine? Worst case, you’ll see me scream like a kitten at the first jump-scare.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.10": "It's nice to have a quiet day inside. Sometimes you need a break from the water.$h",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.11": "The house feels extra cozy today. Maybe I'll make some hot coffee.$h",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.12": "I'm so glad we chose to make our home here. It's perfect for both of us.$h",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.13": "The way you've transformed this farm... it makes me want to be a better partner too.$h",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.14": "Some mornings I wake up and can't believe I get to call you my spouse.$h",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.15": "The farm's looking great, @. Your hard work shows in everything you touch.$h",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.16": "I'm fixing that loose board on the farmhouse porch. Can't have my spouse dealing with that.$h",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.17": "Been messing with the wiring on that old amp. If the lights flicker later, don’t panic.#$b#It probably means I’m doing it right.",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.18": "Maple's been especially clingy today. She followed me from room to room like a tiny, judgmental cloud of fur.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.19": "Sometimes I imagine what life would’ve looked like if I never left Zuzu. Then I see Maple do a binky, and I’m glad I did.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Day.20": "Maple chewed through one of my old shoelaces this morning. She looked so proud. Guess it’s a victory for her.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.1": "Perfect evening for some quiet music. Want to listen while I play something soft on the drums?$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.2": "Thought about heading to the Saloon, but your company’s better.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.3": "The house is quiet. Almost suspiciously so. Maple’s definitely plotting something.$0",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.4": "Been thinking about all the nights we'll have like this. Looking forward to every single one, love.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.5": "I fixed that loose hinge on the coop this morning. Maple supervised, of course.$0#$b#She’s a harsh critic, but she approved eventually.",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.6": "Maple fell asleep in my toolbox again. I swear that bunny’s part gremlin.$0#$b#Cute little menace.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.7": "I was thinking about that day we met. Didn’t expect someone like you to look twice at someone like me. But you did. And I’m glad.$4",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.8": "Sandy sent me some cactus candy from the desert. I have no idea what’s in it...$0#$b#But it’s weirdly good. You want the last one?",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.9": "You're warm, you smell like the garden, and my arms know exactly where to find you in the dark.$1#$b#Yeah... this is the good life.$1",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.10": "Sebastian walked past me without saying a word today.$0#$b#Honestly? Best conversation we’ve ever had.$0",
  "Daulton.Indoor.Night.11": "Remind me not to wear anything too flammable next time we go into the mines.$0#$b#Knowing my luck, I’ll set myself on fire trying to impress you.$1",

  //GINGER ISLAND//
  
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.1": "Now this is what I call a change of scenery. Resort life's got a nice ring to it.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.2": "Island life's got appeal. Wonder what kind of fishing they've got around here.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.3": "If I fall asleep in a hammock, just let me drift. I probably needed it.$2",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.4": "Beach days hit different when you’re not hauling crates at the docks first.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.6": "Sam dared me to cannonball off the pier. Told him I’d think about it... in five drinks.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.8": "Don’t mind me.#$b#Just here to do absolutely nothing, with great enthusiasm.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.9": "Love all these weird bird calls. Island's got its own music going on.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.10": "Not gonna lie.#$b#Last time I saw this much sand, I was stuck digging a trench during a burst pipe job.",
  "Daulton.Resort.Entering.11": "Just saw a parrot carrying a sock. This place never disappoints.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Leaving.4": "Don’t tell anyone, but I might’ve napped through half the trip.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Leaving.5": "Goodbye, sweet hammock. You cradled my laziness like a champ.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Leaving.7": "Time to head back to reality. Resort was nice while it lasted.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Leaving.8": "Weird being this far from my workshop. Hands feel weird when they're not fixing something.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Leaving.9": "Some kid asked if my tattoo meant I used to be a pirate.$0#$b#Told him no, I just made bad decisions in Zuzu City.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Leaving.10": "Back to boring gray seagulls and cold water. This tropical color thing spoiled me.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Shore.2": "I keep expecting to hear Willy yelling at seagulls. Peaceful without it, honestly.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Shore.3": "Beach here's incredible. Different from our valley coastline, but beautiful.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Shore.4": "Perfect spot for some tropical fishing. Wonder what kind of catches they get here.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Shore.5": "Coral's beautiful, but I know what's swimming in deeper waters. I'll stay here thanks.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Shore.6": "Saw a school of silverfin just off the rocks.$0#$b#Almost made me wish I’d brought a rod.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.1": "If anyone asks, I’m meditating. Horizontally.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.2": "Now this is the life. Resort chair, tropical breeze, nothing to fix or build.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.3": "Lay back with me. Let the waves do all the talking for a while.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.4": "Perfect view of these tiny hummingbirds working the flowers. Busy little guys.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.5": "Island air's got that sweet tropical smell. Way better than fish and saltwater.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.6": "They told me to 'relax.' I’m doing my best interpretation of a sea sponge.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.7": "This beats hauling rope any day, but I'd probably get bored without something to fix.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.8": "Been watching these island lizards. They've got more personality than our dock spiders.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.Chair.9": "Love watching the hermit crabs hustle around. Smart little dudes.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Bar.1": "One drink. Maybe two. Definitely no more than three. Probably.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Bar.2": "Ordered something with a flower in it. No clue what’s in the glass, but it’s making me feel mysterious.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Bar.3": "Perfect spot for drowning dock stress in something fruity and overpriced.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.Bar.4": "Not a bad view. You, I mean. The ocean’s alright too, I guess.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.1": "A kid tried to race a gull earlier. Lost, obviously.$0#$b#Still gave it everything he had. Kinda respect that.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.2": "Think they’d let me build a drum set out of coconuts? No? Shame.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.3": "You ever look at the ocean and feel like it’s looking back? ...No? Just me?$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.4": "Some of this coral looks like it’s growing teeth. Not saying I’m scared. But I’m not touching it.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.5": "Saw a crab try to drag off someone’s flip-flop earlier.$0#$b#Ten outta ten effort. I was rooting for it.$1",
  "Daulton.Resort.6": "Island's got me thinking about building a tiki bar back home. Maple would love the tropical vibe.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.7": "Resort's nice, but I keep looking for things to fix or improve. Guess you can take the guy off the docks, but not the docks out of the guy.$0",
  "Daulton.Resort.8": "Been collecting some of these cool shells and coral pieces. Maple would probably try to eat them, but they'd make interesting workshop decorations.$0",

// Maple lines // 

"Maple.General.1": "Maple looks especially content today.$0",
"Maple.General.2": "She’s loafed into the perfect bunny circle.$0",
"Maple.General.3": "A little nose-wiggle says all is well.$0",
"Maple.General.4": "Maple sits peacefully, completely unbothered.$0",
"Maple.General.6": "She’s grooming her paws with the utmost seriousness.$0",
"Maple.General.7": "Maple stretches out luxuriously. Living the dream.$0",
"Maple.General.8": "She hops in a slow, thoughtful little circle.$0",
"Maple.General.10": "She flops dramatically onto her side. Very theatrical.$0",
"Maple.General.11": "There's a speck of hay on her nose. She doesn’t care.$0",
"Maple.General.12": "She thumps once, then goes back to doing absolutely nothing.$0",
"Maple.General.13": "She gives a slow little head tilt. Thinking... probably.$0",
"Maple.General.14": "She looks like she just won a very small, invisible argument.$0",
"Maple.General.15": "She’s nibbling on something. Hopefully not important.$0",
"Maple.General.16": "She appears to be contemplating a mischief she hasn’t committed yet.$0",
"Maple.General.17": "Maple is mid-groom, one ear folded like a tiny sail.$0",
"Maple.General.18": "Maple is watching absolutely nothing. Intensely.$0",
"Maple.General.19": "She does a tiny stretch, then curls back into herself.$0",
"Maple.General.20": "She shifts slightly, fluffs her tail, and settles again.$0",
"Maple.General.21": "She bumps your foot with her nose. Twice. Politely.$1",
"Maple.General.22": "Maple looks perfectly content. Wonder what she’s destroyed by chewing this time.$0",
"Maple.General.23": "She’s sitting very still, which usually means she did something.$0",
"Maple.General.24": "Maple is gently nibbling your shoe.$0",
"Maple.General.25": "Maple flops dramatically, then opens one eye to make sure you noticed.$0",
"Maple.General.26": "Maple hops over, inspects your hand, then gently headbutts it.$1",
"Maple.General.27": "She’s nibbling something invisible on the floor. Or imagining it.$0",
"Maple.General.28": "Her ears are at different angles. She's clearly in deep thought.$0",
"Maple.General.29": "She does the tiniest hop, then looks at you like it was impressive.$1",
"Maple.General.30": "She’s half-asleep, ears twitching at imaginary sounds.$0",
"Maple.General.31": "Maple looks happy to see you.$1",
"Maple.General.32": "She’s loafed nearby, ears relaxed.$0",
"Maple.General.33": "She gives you a quiet little nose wiggle.$1",
"Maple.General.34": "Maple perks up when she sees you.$1",
"Maple.General.35": "She watches you with soft curiosity.$0",
"Maple.General.36": "She gives you a glance and a subtle twitch of her ears.$0",
"Maple.General.37": "She looks perfectly at ease. And slightly superior.$0",
"Maple.General.38": "Her posture says calm. Her eyes say chaos.$0",
"Maple.General.39": "She turns away just as you look. On purpose.$5",
"Maple.General.40": "You’ve been given the silent treatment. It's fine. She’s busy.$5",
"Maple.General.41": "She gives a single, calm hop and settles again. All is well.$0",

"Maple.Happy.1": "She's sitting in her waiting for treats position.$1",
"Maple.Happy.2": "Her ears are forward and relaxed. She's glad you're here.$1",
"Maple.Happy.3": "Her tail does a little wiggle. Pleased to see you.$1",
"Maple.Happy.4": "Her ears track your voice softly. She likes when you talk.$1",
"Maple.Happy.5": "That soft tooth-grinding means she's content with you.$1",
"Maple.Happy.6": "Both ears pointed at you. You have her full attention.$1",
"Maple.Happy.7": "She perks up completely when she sees you.$1",
"Maple.Happy.8": "Her happy tooth-purr starts before you even touch her.$1",

"Maple.Town.Happy.1": "She booped a flower with her nose, then looked at you like: did you see?$1",
"Maple.Town.Happy.2": "She's making a tiny crop circle in the clover.$1",
"Maple.Town.Happy.3": "She's showing you her good side. The other side is also good.$1",
"Maple.Town.Happy.4": "She's grooming with excessive dignity for someone covered in dirt.$1",

"Maple.Annoyed.1": "She turns her back to you. Deliberately.$5",
"Maple.Annoyed.2": "She acknowledges you exist. Barely.$5",
"Maple.Annoyed.3": "One ear toward you. She's not impressed yet.$5",
"Maple.Annoyed.4": "She tolerates your existence with visible reluctance.$5",
"Maple.Annoyed.5": "She's chewing something aggressively while staring at you.$5",
"Maple.Annoyed.6": "She's glaring. Bunnies can absolutely glare.$5",
"Maple.Annoyed.7": "She's doing the absolute minimum acknowledgment of your existence.$5",
"Maple.Annoyed.8": "Her ears are flat. This is your fault somehow.$5",

"Maple.Town.Annoyed.1": "She shifts slightly away. This spot isn't big enough for two.$5",
"Maple.Town.Annoyed.2": "She's investigating a beetle. You're less interesting than the beetle.$5",
"Maple.Town.Annoyed.3": "She's vibrating with the desire to destroy these flowers. But she's resting.$5",
"Maple.Town.Annoyed.4": "She just judged someone's outfit. The ear angle says it all.$5",

"Maple.Angy.1": "She keeps thumping every time you move.$6",
"Maple.Angy.2": "She watches you like she's cataloguing your failures.$6",
"Maple.Angy.3": "Her nose wrinkles slightly. You probably smell wrong.$6",
"Maple.Angy.4": "She's doing that exaggerated yawn. Bored with you.$6",
"Maple.Angy.5": "She gives you the slowest, most dramatic head turn.$6",
"Maple.Angy.6": "Her ear flicks dismissively every time you speak.$6",
"Maple.Angy.7": "She closes her eyes when you look at her. You're dismissed.$6",
"Maple.Town.Angy.1": "She thumps if you get too close to her flowers.$6",

"Maple.Town.1": "She's systematically destroying every pansy. You're not going to stop her.$0",
"Maple.Town.2": "She sees you watching and deliberately eats faster.$0",
"Maple.Town.3": "She pauses her flower massacre to wiggle her nose at you.$0",
"Maple.Town.4": "She hops over with half a flower in her mouth. Want some? No? More for her.$0",
"Maple.Town.5": "She's eaten a perfect circle in someone's flower patch.$1",
"Maple.Town.6": "She binkies between flower beds. Best day ever!$1",

"Maple.Jellies.1": "Maple keeps checking the dock, ears forward. She knows something special happens here soon.",
"Maple.Jellies.2": "She's loafed in the sand, watching the horizon with unusual focus.",
"Maple.Jellies.3": "Her nose twitches at the salt air. She seems expectant.",
"Maple.Jellies.4": "She's settled in for a long wait, eyes on the dark water.",
"Maple.Jellies.5": "Every so often she perks up at a wave, then settles back down disappointed.",
"Maple.Jellies.6":"Maple watches the empty waves. Her ears track each one that breaks.$0",

"Maple.Flower.Festival.1": "She noses a daisy chain toward you, very pleased with herself.$1",
"Maple.Flower.Festival.2": "Flower petals have collected around her like confetti. She doesn't mind.$0",
"Maple.Flower.Festival.3": "Maple watches the festival bustle from her usual spot. The flowers here are especially trampled today.",
"Maple.Flower.Festival.4": "She watches people fuss over their flower arrangements with mild interest.",
"Maple.Flower.Festival.5": "She binkies through a petal drift, then sits like a tiny centerpiece.$1",
"Maple.Flower.Festival.6": "She watches someone carry past a huge bouquet. Her nose follows it all the way.$0",

"Maple.Egg.Festival.1": "She tracks the basket-carrying kids with alert ears, quietly fascinated.$0",
"Maple.Egg.Festival.2": "She's claimed an egg. It's plastic. She seems disappointed but committed.$0",
"Maple.Egg.Festival.3": "She tries to roll a painted egg with her nose. It wobbles away.$1",
"Maple.Egg.Festival.4": "She inspects the dye table; a blue whisker seems likely if you look away.$0",
"Maple.Egg.Festival.5": "Glitter clings to her whiskers from the craft table. She looks very proud.$1",

"Maple.Fair.1": "Maple looks very pleased.#$b#So many new things to nibble on.",
"Maple.Fair.2": "She looks smug, as though the entire fair was arranged for her.$1",
"Maple.Fair.3": "She seems quietly proud to be here with you, her tiny chest puffed.$1",
"Maple.Fair.4": "She sits like a prize on display, fully aware she outshines the trophies.$1",
"Maple.Fair.5": "She poses in a flawless loaf, radiating 'winner' energy.$1",
"Maple.Fair.6": "She sits primly beside you, watching everything with soft curiosity.$0",


// GIFTING 

"MapleAcceptGiftLoved": "Maple does a happy little binky, wiggling with pure joy.$1",
"MapleAcceptGiftLiked": "A polite nose-wiggle of approval. She nibbles contentedly.$1",
"MapleAcceptGiftNeutral": "She sniffs, still deciding what to make of it.$0",
"MapleAcceptGiftDisliked": "Maple's ears flatten.#$b#Message received. Not a fan.$5",
"MapleAcceptGiftHated": "She turns away with a cold nose-flick of pure disdain.$6",

"MapleAcceptGift": "She tilts her head, considering it.$0",

"MapleAcceptGift_Love.1": "Maple does a happy little binky.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.2": "Maple flops over in pure bliss.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.3": "She hops in a jaunty circle, nose twitching.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.4": "Maple gives a joyful head-shake and pounces on the gift.$3",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.5": "That got a full-body wiggle of approval.$3",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.6": "Maple's tail does a proud little flick.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.7": "She zooms in a tiny circle. Bunny joy detected.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.8": "That earned a cozy little loaf next to the gift.$3",
"MapleAcceptGift_Love.9": "Little feet tap in pure delight! Best gift ever.$3",

"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.1": "She turns away with a single nose-flick.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.2": "Maple’s ears flatten.#$b#Message received.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.3": "She flicks her back foot at it in protest.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.4": "That was a firm no, silently communicated.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.5": "Maple gives it one sniff and immediately retreats.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.6": "A single glare. That’s all.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.7": "She hops away dramatically, as if deeply offended.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.8": "She nudges it away...note taken.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.9": "A reluctant hop backward.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.10": "Maple clearly isn’t fond of that.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.11": "She paws at it once, then ignores it entirely.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.12": "She scoots it away with a single paw, unimpressed.$5",
"MapleAcceptGift_Dislike.13": "One sniff was enough.#$b#She’s lost interest entirely.$5",

"MapleAcceptGift_Liked.1": "A polite nose-wiggle of approval.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Liked.2": "She nibbles contentedly.#$b#Good choice.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Liked.3": "Maple gives an appreciative ear-flick.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Liked.4": "She nuzzles it once, then sits beside it like it’s hers now.$1",
"MapleAcceptGift_Liked.5": "A few happy munches, then a cozy flop nearby.$1",

"MapleAcceptGift_Neutral.1": "She sniffs, still deciding.$0",
"MapleAcceptGift_Neutral.2": "Maple inspects it, expression unreadable.$0",
"MapleAcceptGift_Neutral.3": "She circles it once, then waits.$0",
"MapleAcceptGift_Neutral.4": "Bunny judgment is pending.$0",
"MapleAcceptGift_Neutral.5": "A single whisker-twitch. Might need time.$0",
"MapleAcceptGift_Neutral.6": "Neither thrilled nor offended. Just... curious.$0",

"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.1": "She turns her back and gives you the coldest fluff you've ever seen.$6",
"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.2": "She turns her back and pointedly ignores it.$6",
"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.3": "Her ears flatten. That’s a firm no.$6",
"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.4": "Maple gives it a long, judgmental stare.$6",
"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.5": "She scratches at the floor like she's trying to bury it.$6",
"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.6": "She stares at it, then at you, like you should know better.$6",
"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.7": "She lies down with her back to it. Statement made.$6",
"MapleAcceptGift_Hated.8": "She flattens herself like she’s pretending it doesn’t exist.$6",

// Birthday reactions 
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift": "Birthday treats for Maple! Happy birthday, small fluffball!$1",
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift_Love": "Extra-wiggly birthday binky! Her happiest jump yet!$1",
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift_Dislike": "Even on her birthday, that’s a no. She looks away.#$b#Birthday or not.$5",
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift_Loved": "She thumps with excitement and leaps into the air!$1",
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift_Liked": "A pleased hop and a nose-boop.$1#$b#She seems quite satisfied.$1",
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift_Neutral": "She accepts it politely. Undecided, but gracious.$0",
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift_Disliked": "Maple's ears droop.$2#$b#Not her idea of a celebration.$5",
"MapleAcceptBirthdayGift_Hated": "Maple looks mildly betrayed.$6",

// Misc hard-coded keys
"MapleMovieInvitation": "She stares at the ticket like it's food. It isn't. She's disappointed.$5",
"MapleHitBySlingshot": "She darts away in fright.#$b#Careful there! That was alarming. Poor bun.$2",
"MapleDumpsterDiveComment": "Maple wrinkles her nose at the smell. Even a rabbit has standards, it seems.$5",
"MapleFlowerDance_Accept": "Maple looks confused.$0",
"MapleFlowerDance_Decline": "Maple looks confused.$0",
"MapledanceRejection": "Maple looks confused.$0",
"MapleGreenRain": "Maple's posture is different today. She hasn't loafed once since it started. Something's off.$2",
"Maple.GreenRainFinished": "The rain didn't seem to bother her too badly. In fact...she seems brighter.$0#$b#Maple’s fur has a strange shimmer to it. Maybe it’s just the light.$1",
"MapleGreenRain2": "It’s happening again. And Maple seems to recognize it. She looks almost reverent, nose twitching.$0",
"Maple.AcceptRoommate": "She hops in a wide circle, nose twitching excitedly.$1",
"Maple.RejectRoommate": "Maple flicks her foot and turns her back dramatically.$5",


  // Abigail lines //
  "abigail.Sunday4": "Sometimes I hear Daulton playing music from upstairs at the Saloon. It's kind of comforting.",
  "abigail.winter_Fri5": "Daulton went nuts when I found that ancient drum in the mines.$1",
  "abigail.fall_Tue6": "We found a dinosaur egg in the mines! Daulton was more excited than when he caught that legendary fish!",
  "abigail.Saloon_Fri8": "Daulton beat my high score again! Ugh, I need to practice more. Want to team up against him next time?$h",
  "abigail.married_Daulton": "It's so weird seeing Daulton all domestic now. In a good way! You two are perfect together.$h",
  "abigail.dating_Daulton": "So you and Daulton, huh? I can see why you'd like him. He's got that mysterious fisherman vibe going on.$h",

  // Alex lines //
  "alex.eventSeen_7005": "Heard Daulton went on a boat? Man, if I was scared of something, I'd conquer it way faster than that.",

  // Andy lines //
  "andy.summer_Mon": "That Daulton fella helped me haul feed yesterday. Didn't ask for nothin' in return. Good kid.",
  "andy.fall_Thu": "Daulton knows hard work. See him at the docks before dawn most days.",
  "andy.eventSeen_7001": "Heard about Daulton's pa. Losing family...that's rough. Real rough.",
  "andy.eventSeen_7003": "Saw Daulton with that old compass. Didn't pry. Man's business is his own.",
  "andy.winter_Wed": "Daulton don't complain about hard work. Not like these other youngsters.",
  "andy.fairyStone": "Found this weird stone. Maybe that Daulton boy would know. He collects odd things.",
  "andy.fairyrose": "Found these weird roses. Daulton might like 'em for that rabbit of his.",
  
  // Emily lines // 
  "emily.winter_Tue": "The pipes froze again in the Saloon. Good thing Daulton knew how to fix it... Gus was about ready to light a fire under the sink.",
  "emily.summer_28": "Happy birthday to Daulton! I made him a crystal bracelet. Amethyst for protection on the water!$1",
  "emily.fall_Tue": "Daulton's aura is so interesting. Deep blue with flecks of silver. Like the ocean at night!$1",
  
  // Demetrius lines //
  "demetrius.married_Daulton": "Congratulations on marrying Daulton. He's a practical man. I appreciate that.",
  
  // Sam lines //
  "sam.summer_Mon": "Daulton and I have been jamming together! He's got this old drum kit that sounds amazing.",
  "sam.fall_Thu": "Did you know Daulton used to play in a metal band? We should totally start something here in the valley!$1",
  "sam.Fri6": "Daulton's been teaching me some sick drum patterns.",
  "sam.Beach": "If you're looking for Daulton, he's probably helping Willy with the crab pots.",
  "sam.Saloon_Fri6": "Daulton absolutely destroyed me at pool last week. I'm demanding a rematch!",
  "sam.dating_Daulton": "So you and Daulton are together? Nice! He's a really good guy.",
  "sam.engaged_Daulton": "Daulton told me about the engagement! We're planning a bachelor party.$h",
  "sam.married_Daulton_memory_oneday": "Still can't believe you married my best friend! This is like, the best thing ever.$1",
  "sam.married_Daulton_memory_oneweek": "Dude, married life treating you well? Daulton seems happier than ever. Band practice at your place just hits different now.$1",
  "sam.divorced_Daulton": "Hey... I heard about you and Daulton. He's been pretty quiet lately.$s",
  "sam.Mon_inlaw_Daulton": "Your husband and I are working on a new song. It's gonna be epic.",

  //Claire lines //
  "claire.fall_Tue": "Daulton said working for Joja doesn't define me. I... I needed to hear that.",
  "claire.dating_Daulton": "You and Daulton are together? He's such a good listener. You're lucky!",
  
  // Willy lines //
  "willy.Mon4_2": "Daulton's been a real help around here. Good lad.",
  "willy.summer_Wed": "That Daulton works harder than most folks realize.",
  "willy.Fri2": "Daulton caught a beauty of a sturgeon yesterday! All from the pier, of course.$1",
  "willy.Beach": "Daulton usually handles the eastern crab pots. He's got a system worked out.",
  "willy.FishShop": "If I'm not here, Daulton might be able to help ya. He knows his way around the shop.",
  "willy.dating_Daulton": "So you've taken a shine to young Daulton? Good choice! He's got a good heart.$1",
  "willy.engaged_Daulton": "Daulton asked me to be at the wedding! I'm honored. His father would've been proud.$h",
  "willy.married_Daulton": "You take good care of that boy, ya hear? He's special to me.",
  "willy.Beach_inlaw_Daulton": "Your husband's the best dockhand I've ever had. Even with his... peculiarities about boats.",
  "willy.Fri_inlaw_Daulton": "Tell Daulton I saved him some of that bait he likes. The good stuff!$1",
  "willy.eventSeen_7005": "I still can't believe Daulton got on that boat! Proudest day of my life, I tell ya!$1",
  "willy.cc_Boat": "Now that I've got the boat repaired, maybe Daulton will finally... ah, who am I kidding? One step at a time.",
  "willy.divorced_Daulton": "Boy's been working dawn to dusk since... well. Keeping busy helps, I suppose.$s",
  
  // Sebastian //
  "sebastian.fall_Thu": "I heard Daulton thinks I'm pretentious. Takes one to know one, I guess.",
  "sebastian.Beach": "Even Daulton goes outside more than me. That's... actually kind of depressing.$s",
  "sebastian.married_Daulton": "So you married Daulton... I guess he's... fine. Whatever makes you happy.",
  "sebastian.fall_Wed": "Mom tried to give Daulton a life elixir. He said he'd: rather die naturally, thanks. Dramatic much?",

  //Sophia lines //
  "sophia.Saloon_Fri": "Daulton's teaching me pool! I'm terrible but he's really patient about it.",
  "sophia.married_Daulton": "You married Daulton? That's amazing! He's like... actually genuine, you know?$1",
  "sophia.fall_Fri": "Daulton knows all the 'grief holidays' are hard. He just shows up with coffee on those days.$2",
  "sophia.winter_Mon": "He said the guild work helps. Can't be sad when a monster's trying to eat you. Dark but true.$2",
  
  // Marnie lines //
  "marnie.Mon6": "Daulton stopped by for rabbit feed. He really dotes on that Maple!$1",
  "marnie.married_Daulton": "Give Daulton my best! And tell him Maple's welcome to visit my animals anytime.$1",
  "marnie.AnimalShop_Fri": "If you see Daulton, tell him the new rabbit treats came in!",

  // Marlon lines //
  "marlon.adventurerGuild_Mon": "Daulton's one of our steady members. Reliable in the mines, good instincts.",
  "marlon.married_Daulton": "Your husband's prevented several cave-ins with his attention to detail. Good man.",
  "marlon.fall_Wed": "Member Daulton cleared the ice levels last week. Tough job, but he got it done.",
  "marlon.engaged_Daulton": "Heard about the engagement! Daulton's been grinning like a fool between expeditions. Good to see.$1",
  "marlon.divorced_Daulton": "Daulton's been taking the most dangerous assignments lately. Throwing himself into work. Shame about you two.",
  
  // Robin lines //
  "robin.Tue2": "Daulton helped me unload lumber yesterday. Strong as an ox, that one!$1",
  
  // Gus lines //
  "gus.Mon6_2": "Daulton's been a model tenant. Always pays rent on time, keeps the noise down.",
  "gus.summer_Mon": "I save the leftover carrots for Daulton's rabbit. That little critter's got quite an appetite!$1",
  "gus.Saloon": "If you need Daulton, he's probably upstairs. Just knock first...he might be practicing drums.",
  "gus.Saloon_Fri": "Daulton's got next game on the pool table. Fair warning, he's pretty good!",
  "gus.engaged_Daulton": "I'll miss having Daulton as a tenant, but I'm happy for you both!$1",
  "gus.married_Daulton": "The room above the Saloon feels empty without Daulton and Maple. Give them my best!$1",
   "gus.Saloon_inlaw_Daulton": "Your husband still stops by for coffee sometimes. Old habits, you know?",
  "gus.eventSeen_7003": "Daulton seemed pretty shaken up the other day. Everything okay?",
  "gus.winter_Mon": "I left out some carrot tops for Maple again. That bunny’s got me wrapped around her little paw... not that I mind.",
  "gus.spring_Thu4": "Between you and me, Daulton's got a secret weakness for my crab cakes. Don't tell him I told you!",
  "gus.dating_Daulton": "Daulton's been ordering nicer meals lately. Trying to impress someone, perhaps?$h",
  
  // Elliott lines //
  "elliott.spring_Mon": "Daulton has an interesting perspective on life. We've had some profound conversations by the docks.",
  "elliott.summer_Beach": "Daulton and I often watch the sunrise together. He's surprisingly philosophical for someone so grounded.",
  "elliott.fall_Wed": "I've been helping Daulton work through some maritime poetry. Therapeutic, perhaps?",
  "elliott.dating_Daulton": "Ah, young love! Daulton speaks of you often. His usually dry wit becomes quite tender.$1",
  "elliott.married_Daulton": "Your husband has a poet's soul beneath that practical exterior. Cherish that, @.",
  "elliott.married_Daulton_memory_oneweek": "I miss our dawn conversations by the docks. But I'm happy he found love with you.",
  "elliott.spring_Sun": "Maple followed me down to the docks again. I suspect Daulton sent her.#$b#He says she knows when I’m ‘dwelling too long indoors.’ He might be right.",
  "elliott.summer_Sat": "Sometimes Daulton and I debate whether the sea is cruel or merely indifferent. He's quite the philosopher.$1",
  "elliott.engaged_Daulton_memory_oneday": "A wedding approaches! I'm already composing something special for the occasion.",

  // Lance lines //
  "lance.eventSeen_7005": "Facing one's deepest fears... that's the mark of true courage. Well done, Daulton.",
  "lance.married_Daulton": "You've chosen well. Daulton has the loyalty of ancient knights.$5",
  "lance.winter_Wed": "Few members are as consistent as Daulton. You can count on him in a crisis.$5",
  "lance.married_Daulton_2": "Your husband backed me up against a serpent swarm last month. Flawless teamwork.",
  "lance.married_Daulton_memory_oneweek": "Your husband asked me about protection charms for spouses. His devotion to your safety is admirable.",
  
  // Leah lines //
  "leah.spring_16": "Daulton helped me move some heavy sculptures yesterday. He wouldn't even let me pay him!",
  "leah.fall_Mon": "I've been sketching Maple for practice. Daulton's rabbit is surprisingly photogenic!$h",
  "leah.Beach": "Daulton knows all the best spots for finding driftwood. He's been really helpful with my art.$h",
  "leah.married_Daulton": "You and Daulton make a good match.",
  "leah.eventSeen_7006": "That picnic looked romantic! Daulton really knows how to set a scene.",
  "leah.spring_Fri": "I tried to give Daulton a salad once. He was polite, but... let's just say he prefers heartier fare!",
  "leah.dating_Daulton_memory_oneday": "So you and Daulton are official now? That's wonderful!$1",
  
  // Lewis lines //
  "lewis.spring_Mon": "Festival setup’s smoother with Daulton lifting the heavy banners. He’s indispensable.",
  "lewis.married_Daulton": "Another wedding in Pelican Town! Daulton's really put down roots here. Wonderful to see!$1",
  
  // Evelyn lines //
  "evelyn.spring_Tue": "That sweet Daulton helped me with my groceries yesterday. Such a polite young man!",
  "evelyn.summer_23": "Daulton's rabbit got into my garden again! I can't stay mad at that furry little troublemaker.$h",
  "evelyn.married_Daulton": "You married that nice Daulton! He always greets me so politely in town.",
  "evelyn.eventSeen_7002": "That sweet Maple! She was just hungry. I've started leaving carrots out, just in case.$h",
  
   // Penny lines //
  "penny.Tue4": "Daulton offered to teach Vincent about ocean safety. It's nice having another responsible adult around.",
  "penny.married_Daulton": "Congratulations on your marriage! Daulton seems very devoted to you.$1",
  
  // Pam lines //
  "pam.married_Daulton": "You snagged yourself a handy one! He fixed my TV last month.",
  
  // Maru lines //
  "Maru.fall_Thu": "Mom made Daulton a bean hotpot once. He ate it to be polite but I could tell he hated it.",
  
  // Morris lines //
  "morris.Mon": "That Daulton fellow refuses to shop at JojaMart. His loss. We have excellent seafood prices!",
  
  // Sandy lines //
  "sandy.Mon3": "Hi sweetie! Have you met my friend Daulton? He visits the desert sometimes to clear his head.",
  "sandy.Fri5": "Daulton brought me some shells from the beach last time. Such a thoughtful guy!$h",
  "sandy.dating_Daulton": "Oh, you're dating Daulton! He mentioned someone special but wouldn't give details. Now I know why he was glowing!$1",
  "sandy.engaged_Daulton": "Engaged to Daulton?! Oh honey, I'm so happy! He deserves someone who sees how special he is.$1",
  "sandy.married_Daulton": "You married Daulton? How wonderful! Give him my love!$1",

  // Olivia lines //
  "olivia.dating_Daulton": "Daulton? An interesting choice. He does have a certain... rugged charm.",
  "olivia.jenkinsHouse": "Victor could learn from Daulton's work ethic. Perhaps I should hire him for odd jobs?",
  "olivia.engaged_Daulton": "Congratulations on your engagement! I'll ensure the wine selection is appropriate.",
  
  // Caroline lines //
  "caroline.Tue": "Daulton helped me carry some heavy flower pots the other day. Such a strong and quiet young man.",
  "caroline.married_Daulton": "I'm very happy for you and Daulton. He seems very grounded. I can see why you chose him.",
  "caroline.Mon": "I caught Daulton talking to Maple like she was a person. Sweetest thing I’ve seen all week.$1",
  
  // Jodi lines //
  "jodi.Wed5": "Sam keeps talking about Daulton. I think he really looks up to him.",
  "jodi.Mon2": "Sam's been so much happier since Daulton moved to town. It's nice he has someone who shares his music interests!$1",
  
  // Wizard lines //
  "wizard.married_Daulton": "Ah, you are bound to Daulton now. The threads of fate approve.",
  
  // Shane lines //
  "shane.Saloon": "Daulton’s alright. We don’t talk much, but we don’t need to. That’s the kind of friend I like.",

  // Jas lines //
  "jas.Friday2": "Daulton says you have to be very still if you want animals to trust you. I’m practicing!",
  "jas.Sat5": "Daulton said Maple used to be a city rabbit. That’s funny to think about.$1",
  "jas.fall_Sat": "I drew a picture of Maple for Mr. Daulton. He said he'd hang it in his room!",
  "jas.married_Daulton": "Is Maple living on your farm now? Can I visit her? Please?",
  "jas.engaged_Daulton": "A wedding! Can I be flower girl? Can Maple wear a bow?$1",
  
  // Haley lines //
  "haley.Beach": "Daulton's always working with those gross crab pots. I don't know how he stands the smell.$2",
  "haley.married_Daulton": "So you and Daulton...$0#$b#Well... I guess he does have nice arms from all that dock work.$1",
  "haley.summer_Wed": "Ew, I saw Daulton eating a whole fried eel. How can anyone like that slimy stuff?$2",
  
  // George lines //
  "George.Mon2": "That dock-hand tightened my porch rail without asking. Guess muscles are good for something.",
  "George.Tue4": "Bah, Daulton calls that rabbit co-captain. In my day, animals stayed in the barn where they belonged.$u",
  
  // Clint lines //
  "clint.engaged_Daulton": "Uh... congrats on the engagement. He seems... dependable.$u",
  "clint.married_Daulton": "You... you married Daulton. That's... that's great. He's a lucky guy.",
  "clint.eventSeen_7003": "Saw Daulton looking at some old compass yesterday. Seemed pretty torn up about it.", 
  
  // Vincent lines //
  "vincent.eventSeen_7002": "Miss Penny said we shouldn't chase rabbits but Maple was so fluffy! Mr. Daulton wasn't mad though.",

  // Victor lines //
  "victor.fall_Tue": "Mother thinks Daulton's a 'salt of the earth' type. I think she means it positively?",
  "victor.winter_jenkinsHouse": "Daulton visited to help with repairs! Mother was impressed by his work ethic.",
  "victor.winter_Tue": "Daulton said I'm 'not as soft as I look.' I think that was a compliment?",
  "victor.dating_Daulton": "You're dating Daulton? Wonderful! He mentioned someone special but wouldn't give details!",
  "victor.adventurerGuild": "Marlon says Daulton's one of their most dependable members. Mother was impressed.",


